OL,3,GNEWSABoxing club set 'for 100 years'
OL,4,Aafter #1m raised
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's boxing club has had it
OL,7,Ffuture secured "for 100 years" after
OL,8,Fraising #1m, leaders say.
OL,10,FThe Guernsey Amalgamated Boxing Club
OL,11,Fhas been based in its St Martin's
OL,12,Fbuilding since 1935, but members said
OL,13,Fthe site was now "essentially falling
OL,14,Fdown".
OL,16,FMembers set out to raise the mammoth
OL,17,Famount a year ago and, through the
OL,18,Fefforts of volunteers and donations
OL,19,Ffrom the community, they now had enough
OL,20,Fmoney to refurbish the facility into a
OL,21,Fstate-of-the-art club building, leaders
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
