OL,3,GNEWSABoxing club set 'for 100 years'
OL,4,Aafter #1m raised
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe club said "elated was an
OL,7,Funderstatement" after it reached the
OL,8,Ftarget, and it was predicting work on
OL,9,Fthe site would begin in 2027.
